# v1.5.10 with what a tool says about its own limits carried to the analyst:
# analyze_disk_pcaps reports no_results and what it searched, run_clamav warns
# when it scans a disk image as one file (in its result and indexed text),
# get_completed_results and indexed results pass on status, message and
# warning, the executor prompts copy them into a "note", and the analyst
# receives that note. Candidate fixes, not upstream yet.
